   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Addresses",
   "texto": [
    "**左边** is left, **右边**, right; **东边**, east; **西边**, west; **南边**, south; **北边**, north. **附近** means close, **远**, far and **近**, close.",
    "**楼** is a building or floor of a building; **楼上** is up and **楼下** is down."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask the address",
   "texto": [
    "**地址** means postal address. **离** introduces the distance from one place: **我家离学校不远** («My house is not far from school.»).",
    "In Spanish «close» usually goes before «of»; here the point of reference follows to ∞."
   ]
